  "//": "Type gate for the lease builder. vitest strips types without checking them, so a test fixture missing a required ClauseFacts field passes green while silently feeding `undefined` into every includeWhen predicate \u2014 which is exactly what happened, and what this caught. Scoped to lease/ plus its own server-only module: the wider package has pre-existing type errors in sso-provider-config.test.ts that are out of scope for this feature. Extended 2026-09-06 to cover mca/: the prescribed-form checker compares strings that must match a statute, and a type error there is the same class of silent-green failure this file was created for.",
